<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main id="main-content" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <% if (found) { %>
      <section aria-labelledby="detail-title" class="py-8">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4">
          <a href="/produk" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline">&larr; Kembali ke Produk</a>
        </nav>

        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-wrap gap-8">
          <div class="text-8xl flex-1 min-w-[200px] text-center" aria-hidden="true">📦</div>
          <div class="flex-[2] min-w-[280px]">
            <h1 id="detail-title" class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark mb-1"><%= product.name %></h1>
            <p class="text-gray-500 capitalize mb-2">Kategori: <%= product.category %></p>
            <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark mb-2">Rp <%= product.price.toLocaleString('id-ID') %></p>
            <p class="mb-4">Stok tersedia: <strong><%= product.stock %></strong></p>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-5"><%= product.description %></p>

            <aside aria-label="Catatan" class="bg-primary-light border-l-4 border-primary rounded-md px-4 py-3 text-sm text-gray-600">
              <p>Ingin memesan? Fitur checkout akan tersedia di sesi berikutnya. Sementara ini kamu bisa hubungi toko lewat WhatsApp.</p>
            </aside>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>
    <% } else { %>
      <section aria-labelledby="not-found-title" class="text-center py-20">
        <h1 id="not-found-title" class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-dark mb-3">Produk Tidak Ditemukan</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Maaf, produk dengan ID tersebut tidak ada dalam data kami.</p>
        <a href="/produk" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold bg-primary text-white hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors">Kembali ke Daftar Produk</a>
      </section>
    <% } %>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
